  "statuteText": "265:117 Transporting Hazardous Materials or Wastes. –\n\nNotwithstanding RSA 265:115 relative to the transportation of explosives, any person driving any vehicle transporting any hazardous materials or wastes upon a way shall at all times comply with rules adopted by the commissioner pursuant to RSA 106-A:18."
